<title>POLAND: Polish shares close mixed in continuous trade.</title>
<headline>Polish shares close mixed in continuous trade.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Seven stocks rose, six fell and six were flat in a 19.3-million-zloty turnover in Warsaw bourse continuous trade on Thursday, with the WIG 20 index easing 0.4 percent to 1,864.7 points.</p>
<p>The remaining three stocks did not trade.</p>
<p>NFI units rose 3.8 percent to 164 zlotys in a 33.4-million-zloty turnover.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
